  "method": [
    "Fresh calculation directly parsed frozen NBA Stats boxscoretraditionalv3 and playbyplayv3 JSON, the 2025-26 NBA player game logs/LeagueDash data, ESPN special-stat source payloads, league.json, and the CSV outputs. The ranking builder was not imported or executed.",
    "For each sampled played player-game, raw boxscore counts were read by personId; player-attributed Foul actions supplied TECH/FF, Ejection actions supplied EJCT, and PTS/REB/AST/STL/BLK determined DD/TD. Free Throw actions were excluded from foul counts.",
    "Custom FP was independently summed using all weights in league.json; DD means at least two of PTS/REB/AST/STL/BLK >= 10 and TD means at least three, with both bonuses cumulative.",
    "Historical forecasts were recomputed from raw season player game logs plus named ESPN special-stat fields. Projection shrinkage, minute blending, availability, and expected FP/team-game were calculated from the report formula; the 2025-26 availability population was reconstructed by joining LeagueDash GP>=20 rows to ESPN special stats after removing common name suffixes and normalizing accents/punctuation.",
    "Each team score was recomputed as the sum of the ten highest player projected expected FP/team-game values in player-model CSV, then ranked across all 16 teams and compared with the team-rankings CSV."
  ],
